        "body":
            "Emotional intelligence (EI) is the ability to notice, understand and manage emotions in yourself and others. It predicts how well people lead, collaborate and cope with pressure, and unlike IQ it keeps growing with practice.\n\nKey ideas\n\u2022 The four EI domains are self-awareness, self-management, social awareness and relationship management.\n\u2022 Emotions carry information: they signal what matters to you and to others.\n\u2022 EI is a set of skills, so it improves with deliberate practice and feedback.\n\nTry this\nFor three days, note one moment each day when an emotion changed how you acted. Name the emotion and what triggered it.",
