        "body":
            "Empathy is understanding another person's feelings and perspective without judging them. Social awareness extends this to reading the mood and dynamics of a group.\n\nKey ideas\n\u2022 Listen to understand, not to reply or fix.\n\u2022 Reflect back what you heard: \"It sounds like you are worried about the deadline.\"\n\u2022 Watch tone, posture and what is not being said.\n\nTry this\nIn your next one-to-one, spend the first five minutes only asking questions and reflecting back what you hear.",
