        "type": "reading",
        "url": "",
        "fileName": "",
        "body":
            "Stress is the body's response to demands. Mindfulness helps you spot early warning signs and choose a helpful response, and how you view stress changes how it affects you.\n\nKey ideas\n\u2022 Notice early signs: shallow breathing, tension, irritability.\n\u2022 Use a short STOP routine: Stop, Take a breath, Observe, Proceed.\n\u2022 Seeing stress as energy for a challenge can improve performance.\n\nTry this\nUse the STOP routine twice a day for a week and note any difference in how you respond.",
        "minutes": 10,
