        "type": "reading",
        "url": "",
        "fileName": "",
        "body":
            "Mindful communication means being fully present in conversations: listening with attention, noticing your own reactions and choosing words with care.\n\nKey ideas\n\u2022 Put devices away and give the speaker your full attention.\n\u2022 Notice the urge to interrupt and let the other person finish.\n\u2022 Pause before replying to an email that triggers you.\n\nTry this\nIn two meetings this week, listen without preparing your reply. Summarise what you heard before you speak.",
