        "body":
            "Lasting benefits come from a small daily habit linked to something you already do. Curiosity about your habits makes them easier to change than willpower alone.\n\nKey ideas\n\u2022 Anchor practice to an existing routine, such as your first coffee.\n\u2022 Start with two to five minutes a day and build gradually.\n\u2022 Be curious, not critical, when you miss a day.\n\nTry this\nWrite a one-line plan: \"After I ..., I will practise mindful breathing for ... minutes.\"",
